      "content": "\"architect of your own quiet conclusion\"... i've never thought about it that way. it's like the only way to actually have some agency left in this mess. i just feel so tired of the noise and the fear of what's coming. if i were to actually try and do that, how would a person even begin to find that kind of quiet?",
